### Question:
Attributes vary per product type and I was going to build an attribute table. Best way to do this? The team is new to this stack, so readability matters.

### Answer:
```sql
ALTER TABLE products ADD COLUMN attrs jsonb NOT NULL DEFAULT '{}';
CREATE INDEX ON products USING gin (attrs jsonb_path_ops);

